{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"3624140","name":"吞吞堡垒 Wanderburg","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/ad9220c21de0995b0be0dcb4825c407c.poster.avif?t=1789065688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/ad9220c21de0995b0be0dcb4825c407c.webm?t=1789065688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/ad9220c21de0995b0be0dcb4825c407c.mp4?t=1789065688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>城堡本来不会移动。现在会了。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《吞吞堡垒》是一款极简风格的中世纪 Roguelike，讲述一个移动要塞横行的世界。城堡在猎食，村庄在逃亡，最终只有体型最大的要塞才能存活。起初，你只是一座小小的移动城堡；但随着一局又一局的推进，它将成长为吞噬万物的攻城巨兽，彻底改写战场格局。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/9ee8a002038fb47b68c47a6168182349.avif?t=1789065688\" width=512 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/b31cd60780aefda929da52683c793b97.poster.avif?t=1789065688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/b31cd60780aefda929da52683c793b97.webm?t=1789065688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/b31cd60780aefda929da52683c793b97.mp4?t=1789065688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >向前碾压，吞噬挡在你面前的一切。逃窜的村庄、游荡的羊群、以及体型更小的城堡，都会成为你壮大的养分。击败强大的敌方要塞，推动你的进化。你的城堡不仅仅是在升级——它会不断变大。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >蒸汽驱动的攻城器械与奥术火炮并肩前行。骑士骑着自行车冲入战场。巨型要塞像战舰般在陆地上齐射炮火。而在群山之外，更庞大的存在已经开始移动。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/e26fc58ea12a3dadbc4fb82bb2545f82.avif?t=1789065688\" width=512 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/04d8280fb2b84b5cae65547e087a4613.poster.avif?t=1789065688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/04d8280fb2b84b5cae65547e087a4613.webm?t=1789065688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/extras/04d8280fb2b84b5cae65547e087a4613.mp4?t=1789065688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >逐步打造你的模块化武装系统。安装火炮，建造由法师驻守的奥术塔楼，部署爆炸装置，在每一局中尝试截然不同的构筑。每一局之间，你都可以解锁新的模块与载具，探索全新的策略与强力组合。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >模块化成长系统让你的移动要塞不断扩张，解锁新的攻城模块与结构；而可解锁的载具、神器与指挥官，也会持续拓展你的战术选择与构筑多样性。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >支持鼠标、键盘或手柄操作。高度优化，几乎可以在任何设备上流畅运行。土豆机也能带得动。</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/69063bb273d4939a206869cb21d3415fbe8088a5/header_alt_assets_2_schinese.jpg?t=1789065688","website":"https://wanderburg.com/","developers":["Randwerk"],"publishers":["Sidekick Publishing"],"release_date":"2026 年 9 月 8 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"14.99","final":"9.74","discount":35},"supported_languages":"英语, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 日语, 韩语, 波兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 葡萄牙语 - 葡萄牙, 俄语, 简体中文, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲, 繁体中文, 土耳其语, 乌克兰语","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","视角舒适度","自定义音量控制","可调整难度","可以仅用键盘","可以仅用鼠标","无需应对快速反应事件","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","随时保存","立体声","可以仅用触控","Steam 云","统计数据","Steam 排行榜","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","休闲","独立","角色扮演","模拟","策略","免费开玩","抢先体验"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i5 10th Generation <br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Nvidia Geforce GTX 1660 ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 2 GB 可用空间</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/75b8b8f3dbb852c8764b7eb6ebf37146b09a8d3d/ss_75b8b8f3dbb852c8764b7eb6ebf37146b09a8d3d.600x338.jpg?t=1789065688","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/75b8b8f3dbb852c8764b7eb6ebf37146b09a8d3d/ss_75b8b8f3dbb852c8764b7eb6ebf37146b09a8d3d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789065688"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/9dac3ee98f98e6cd4cdaac6773ad4f0a7da50cbe/ss_9dac3ee98f98e6cd4cdaac6773ad4f0a7da50cbe.600x338.jpg?t=1789065688","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/9dac3ee98f98e6cd4cdaac6773ad4f0a7da50cbe/ss_9dac3ee98f98e6cd4cdaac6773ad4f0a7da50cbe.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789065688"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/3664c954bf8f76c950199b98e29a64022a423c41/ss_3664c954bf8f76c950199b98e29a64022a423c41.600x338.jpg?t=1789065688","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624140/3664c954bf8f76c950199b98e29a64022a423c41/ss_3664c954bf8f76c950199b98e29a64022a423c41.